---
source: src/reminders/expiry_email.rs
expression: email.html
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
<title>Your sandbox issuer expires in 7 days</title>
<style>
  /* Inline styles carry the light scheme for every client; these rules adapt it where
     clients read a style sheet. */
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .container { width: 100% !important; }
    .gutter { padding-left: 24px !important; padding-right: 24px !important; }
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .page { background-color: #0b1120 !important; }
    .card { background-color: #111827 !important; border-color: #334155 !important; }
    .text { color: #f1f5f9 !important; }
    .muted { color: #a3b1c6 !important; }
    .facts { background-color: #1e293b !important; }
    .link { color: #7ccbe9 !important; }
    .button { background-color: #25a8db !important; }
    .button-label { color: #101828 !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body class="page" style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f8fafc;">
<div style="display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; opacity: 0; mso-hide: all;">Acme Wallet Issuer stops being active on Tuesday, 1 December 2026, 14:05 UTC. Renew it in the portal to keep it working.</div>
<table role="presentation" class="page" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #f8fafc;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 16px;">
      <table role="presentation" class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 600px; max-width: 600px;">
        <tr>
          <td class="gutter" style="background-color: #144587; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0; padding: 20px 40px;">
            <a href="https://portal.example.com" style="text-decoration: none;"><img src="https://portal.example.com/email/adorsys-logo.png" width="135" height="24" alt="adorsys" style="display: block; border: 0; outline: none; color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 24px;"></a>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="card gutter text" style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-top: 0; border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px; padding: 32px 40px; color: #101828; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">

            <h1 class="text" style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #101828; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 600;">Your sandbox issuer expires in 7 days</h1>
            <p class="text" style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #101828;"><strong>Acme Wallet Issuer</strong> stops being active on <strong>Tuesday, 1 December 2026, 14:05 UTC</strong>. Renew it before then to keep it working.</p>
            <table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 6px; margin: 0 0 24px;">
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 16px 16px 4px;">
                  <p class="muted" style="margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">Issuer</p>
                  <p class="text" style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: #101828; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;">Acme Wallet Issuer</p>
                  <p class="muted" style="margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">Issuer ID</p>
                  <p class="text" style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: #101828; font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; word-break: break-all;">6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4c1e-9a53-2f8d7e4b1c00</p>
                  <p class="muted" style="margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">Expires</p>
                  <p class="text" style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: #101828; font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px;">Tuesday, 1 December 2026, 14:05 UTC</p>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
            <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 0 24px;">
              <tr>
                <td class="button" style="background-color: #144587; border-radius: 6px;">
                  <a href="https://portal.example.com/issuers/6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4c1e-9a53-2f8d7e4b1c00" class="button-label" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Renew the issuer</a>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
            <p class="muted" style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #475569; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Once it has expired, renewing it brings it back only while the sandbox has room for it. If you no longer need the issuer, you can ignore this email.</p>
            <p class="muted" style="margin: 0; color: #475569; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">If the button does not work, open <a href="https://portal.example.com/issuers/6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4c1e-9a53-2f8d7e4b1c00" class="link" style="color: #144587; word-break: break-all;">https://portal.example.com/issuers/6f1c2a9e-0b7d-4c1e-9a53-2f8d7e4b1c00</a></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="gutter muted" style="padding: 24px 40px; color: #475569; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;">
            <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;">You get this email because you registered this issuer on the Status List Portal, which sends reminders to your GitHub account's primary email. The portal emails you only about your issuers.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Status List Portal by adorsys &middot; <a href="https://portal.example.com" class="link" style="color: #144587;">https://portal.example.com</a></p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
